---

This project aggregates technique indexes and pointers into publicly available
offensive-security reference corpora (Atomic Red Team, HackTricks skills,
ired.team notes, Claude-BugHunter, RedTeam-Tools, Red-Teaming-Toolkit,
Awesome-Red-Teaming). Those corpora retain their own licenses; RedAgent only
reads them locally and does not redistribute their content. Use RedAgent only
against systems you own or are contractually authorized to test.
